Here is a complete breakdown of how quests, objectives, and their intersecting narrative systems are currently architected, documented, and wired up across the engine—including both manual (authored) and procedural/emergent capabilities, plus an honest audit of where the current wiring has gaps.
1. Where Are These Systems Documented & Mapped Out?
Currently, the documentation is spread across the architectural and SSOT registries rather than living in a single dedicated Narrative/Quest design document:
